      "content": "1. 839                                             GOSSOMS END                                                 No 64 SP 9908 SW 5/125 II                                GV 2. Early C19.  Red brick, Welsh slated roof. 2 storeys, 1st floor Yorkshire casement with glazing bars.  Ground floor segmental bow window with glazing bars, slim panelled pilasters, simplified entablature with consoles either end to cornice. Nos 62 to 64 (consec) form a group. Listing NGR: SP9829208283"
